- Consumes: all prior source changes and generated Windows artifacts.
- Produces: verified local 2.2.2 NSIS/portable release candidates and an updated local code graph.

- [ ] **Step 1: Run focused and full validation**

Run:

~~~
npm test
npm run test:desktop
npm run build
npm run desktop:dist
npm run desktop:test-package
npm run audit:public
git diff --check
~~~

